      "paragraphs": [
        "Jack Campbell, the former Leafs goaltender, has officially announced his retirement at 34 to become a performance coach with Novus Global. The Leafs are now looking toward the upcoming season, with their first game set against the Canadiens on Tuesday, September 29. Meanwhile, the Jays lost 3-0 to the White Sox last night as their offense failed to support starter Yesavage. Tonight, the Jays face the Rays at 7:07 PM ET on Sportsnet, aiming to improve their 46-53 record and 5th-place standing in the AL East.",
